    "title": "Scooter Space",
    "description": "Game of Scooter (Kick board).\r\nEnjoy battles and chats in multiplayer mode.\r\nOne park per person is given. It is freely customizable.\r\nParks created by someone continue to be released one after another.\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - \r\n\r\nSpace for playing Scooter.\r\nIt is a game where you can experience the various attractions of Scooter. You can enjoy freely without any rules or restrictions.\r\nPlease wear the clothes you want to wear and go to the place you want to go, make your favorite tricks.\r\n\r\nYou can\r\n\u30fbCustomize your avatar and fashion.\r\n\u30fbCustomize your own park.\r\n\u30fbConfigure trick list.\r\n\u30fbPlay Scooter in the parks of others.\r\n\u30fbPlay Scooter together while chatting.\r\n\u30fbTry to Score Mission.\r\n\u30fbMultiplayer online battle with up to 10 scooters.\r\n\r\nBy use the rich features in the game,\r\nPlease show off your style.",
